[FEN "4k1K1/3R2P1/8/7r/8/8/8/8 w - - 0 1"]
[LineName "01. The Lucena: build a bridge (2/4)"]
[LineDescription "Rook to the 4th rank: the bridge shelters your king from the checks, and the pawn queens."]

{[%csl Gd4] Your king will hide at the edge of the board: build the shelter for
it there.} 1. Rd4 {Rd4 — Build the bridge: your rook goes to the 4th rank.} 1...
Rh3 {[%csl Ge4]} 2. Re4+ {Re4+ — Check: the black king steps away and is cut
off.} 2... Kd7 {[%csl Be1,Be2,Be3,Be5,Be6,Be7,Be8]} 3. Kf7 {Kf7 — Your king
steps out, still next to the pawn.} 3... Rf3+ 4. Kg6 Rg3+ 5. Kh6 {Kh6! — Not
Kh5: Black takes the pawn.} 5... Kd8 {[%csl Gh4]} 6. Rh4 {Rh4! — Shield your
king: the rook blocks checks on the h-file.} 6... Kc8 7. Kh7 {Kh7! — Not g8=Q+:
Black takes the queen.} 7... Kb8 8. g8=Q+ {[%also g8=R+] g8=Q+ — Queen! The win
is safe.} *

