[LineName "01. The Lucena: build a bridge (3/4)"]
[LineDescription "Rook to the 4th rank: the bridge shelters your king from the checks, and the pawn queens."]

{[%csl Bd1,Bd2,Bd3,Bd5,Bd6,Bd7,Bd8,Gb4] The black king is cut off. Your king
steps out towards the edge, and the rook shelters it there.} 1. Rb4 Rf8+ 2. Kb7
Rf7 3. Kb8 {Kb8! — The rook still shields your king.} 3... Rf8+ 4. c8=Q+ {[%also
c8=R] c8=Q+ — Queen! The win is safe.} *

