Rc1+ 4. Kb6 Rb1+ 5. Ka6 {Ka6! — Not Kc5: Black takes the pawn.} 5... Ke8 {[%csl
Ga4]} 6. Ra4 {Ra4! — Shield your king: the rook blocks checks on the a-file.}
6... Kf8 7. Ka7 {Ka7! — Not b8=Q+: Black takes the queen.} 7... Kg8 8. b8=Q+
{[%also b8=R+] b8=Q+ — Queen! The win is safe.} *

