[LineName "03. The skewer (3/4)"]
[LineDescription "Clear the queening square: if the black rook takes the pawn, a check on the 7th rank wins it."]

{[%csl Bb7,Bc7,Bd7,Bf7,Bg7,Bh7] Black checks first again. Then the trap.} 1. Rg8
{Rg8! — Not Rb8: Black takes the pawn.} 1... Ra6+ 2. Kh7 {Kh7! — If ...Rxa7,
Rg7+ wins the rook.} 2... Rxa7 3. Rg7+ {Rg7+! — Check: the rook behind the king
falls.} 3... Kd8 4. Rxa7 {Rxa7 — The rook is won: the win is safe.} *

